  <!-- ===== 3M ===== -->
  <section class="section" id="3m" aria-label="Spesifikasi Kaca Film 3M">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="hero-tag">Merek #3</div>
        <h2>🔴 3M</h2>
        <p>Raksasa teknologi asal AS (1902). Kaca film 3M terkenal dengan inovasi <strong>multilayer optical film</strong> — 200+ layer nano teknologi. Sebagian besar seri <strong>non-metal</strong>, jadi aman untuk sinyal GPS/HP. Garansi resmi 5 tahun.</p>
      </div>

      <h3>3M Crystalline — Flagship (Non-Metal ✅, IR 97%)</h3>
      <p style="margin-bottom:12px;">Teknologi multilayer optical film 200+ layer. IR 97% di hampir semua varian. Non-metal, sinyal aman.</p>
      <div class="table-wrap" role="region" aria-label="Spesifikasi 3M Crystalline" tabindex="0">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr><th>Varian</th><th>VLT (approx)</th><th>IR</th><th>TSER</th><th>UVR</th><th>Cocok</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>CR70</td><td>~70%</td><td class="accent-value">97%</td><td>50%</td><td>99%</td><td>Depan (lolos tilang)</td></tr>
            <tr><td>CR60</td><td>~60%</td><td class="accent-value">97%</td><td>53%</td><td>99%</td><td>Depan / Sunroof</td></tr>
            <tr><td>CR40</td><td>~40%</td><td class="accent-value">97%</td><td class="accent-value">60%</td><td>99%</td><td>Depan / Samping / Sunroof</td></tr>
            <tr><td>CR20</td><td>~20%</td><td class="accent-value">97%</td><td class="accent-value">62%</td><td>99%</td><td>Samping</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <h3>3M Prestige / Sun Control PR 70 — Buat Depan (Non-Metal ✅, IR 97%)</h3>
      <p style="margin-bottom:12px;">VLT <strong>70%</strong> — lolos aturan tilang, IR 97%. Non-metal, sinyal aman. Satu-satunya kaca film VLT 70% non-metal dengan IR setinggi ini.</p>
      <div class="table-wrap" role="region" aria-label="Spesifikasi 3M Prestige" tabindex="0">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr><th>Varian</th><th>VLT</th><th>IR</th><th>UVR</th><th>Cocok</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>Prestige PR 70</td><td class="accent-value">70%</td><td class="accent-value">97%</td><td>—</td><td>Depan ✅ lolos tilang + sinyal aman</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Exterior PR 70</td><td class="accent-value">70%</td><td class="accent-value">97%</td><td>—</td><td>Depan (eksterior)</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <h3>3M Black Beauty — Entry Level (Non-Metal ✅)</h3>
      <p style="margin-bottom:12px;">Non-metal, tidak ganggu sinyal. Entry level dari 3M.</p>
      <div class="table-wrap" role="region" aria-label="Spesifikasi 3M Black Beauty" tabindex="0">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr><th>Varian</th><th>VLT</th><th>IR</th><th>TSER</th><th>UVR</th><th>Cocok</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>BB 35</td><td>39%</td><td>39%</td><td>40%</td><td>99%</td><td>Depan / Sunroof</td></tr>
            <tr><td>BB 20</td><td>19%</td><td>51%</td><td>51%</td><td>99%</td><td>Samping</td></tr>
            <tr><td>BB 5</td><td>9%</td><td>58%</td><td>57%</td><td>99%</td><td>Samping (gelap)</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <h3>3M Black Chrome — TSER Tinggi (Metal ⚠️)</h3>
      <p style="margin-bottom:12px;">Teknologi metalik — TSER tinggi sampai 72%, tapi <strong>bisa ganggu sinyal</strong>.</p>
      <div class="table-wrap" role="region" aria-label="Spesifikasi 3M Black Chrome" tabindex="0">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr><th>Varian</th><th>TSER</th><th>UVR</th><th>Cocok</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>BC 40</td><td>47%</td><td>99%</td><td>Depan</td></tr>
            <tr><td>BC 20</td><td>68%</td><td>99%</td><td>Samping</td></tr>
            <tr><td>BC 10</td><td class="accent-value">72%</td><td>99%</td><td>Samping (super gelap)</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <h3>3M Obsidian — Varian VLT Terlengkap (Non-Metal ✅)</h3>
      <p style="margin-bottom:12px;">Mulai VLT 8% sampai 78%, non-metal. TSER rendah (23-44%), cocok untuk yang prioritas varian keteduhan bukan performa panas.</p>
